@startuml Sequence Diagram - Denied Payment
title Escenario 2 - Pago Rechazado (Simulator API)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Comercio\n(Backend)" as Comercio
participant "SDK KitPagos" as SDK
participant "Simulator API\n(Fastify)" as SimAPI
participant "Scenario Engine" as Engine

Comercio -> SDK : createPayment(CreatePaymentRequest)
SDK -> SimAPI : POST /simulate/{gateway}/payments
SimAPI -> Engine : resolveScenario(orderReference) -> "decline"
Engine --> SimAPI : payload nativo rechazado
SimAPI --> SDK : GatewayCreateTransactionResult{rawStatus: nativo}
note left of SDK
  rawGatewayResponse trae el detalle nativo,
  pero sin normalizar aun
end note
SDK --> Comercio : CreatePaymentResult{transactionStatus: DECLINED}

SDK -> SimAPI : getTransactionStatus({gateway, gatewayTransactionId})
SimAPI -> Engine : resolveScenario(...) -> mismo "decline"\n(deterministico)
Engine --> SimAPI : payload nativo con motivo de rechazo
SimAPI --> SDK : TransactionStatusResponse nativo
SDK -> SDK : mapear rawStatus -> rejectionCode + rejectionCategory
SDK --> Comercio : TransactionStatusResponse{DECLINED,\nrejectionCode, rejectionCategory}

note right of Engine
  Wompi: status_message (texto libre)
  Rapyd: failure_code "ERROR_PROCESSING_CARD - [51]"
  (ej. fondos insuficientes)
  Mercado Pago: status_detail (cc_rejected_insufficient_amount)
  Kushki: code + processorError
end note

@enduml
